{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><p>巴黎時裝周昨日（6日）隆重揭幕，全球名人巨星都現身法國巴黎出席奢侈品牌時裝騷，包括范冰冰、影后楊紫瓊、梁洛施、韓國人氣男團Seventeen成員Mingyu、奚夢瑤、谷愛凌、泰德混血女星Kimberley Anne Woltemas等，場面星光熠熠。</p><figure><img alt=\"梁洛施Keep得好好！（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151141924166569984973658.jpeg/K-JJMQbrxxNUw-tt1OuDLcAIa5XqTWii0NKXodDSl6E\"/><figcaption>梁洛施Keep得好好！（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"氣質高貴優雅。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151141921050071040157930.jpeg/8JEY8mJzkhS6Lu3-z3v-aJ-GxOeovqRx_qYWnf6mFp0\"/><figcaption>氣質高貴優雅。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><p>范冰冰梁洛施現身巴黎時裝周</p><p>梁洛施穿上一身優雅高貴套裝驚喜現身巴黎時裝周，並在社交平台分享了在巴黎街頭的街拍。從照片可見，戴上太陽眼鏡的梁洛施一身牛仔造型亮相，無論樣貌及身材都保養得宜，非常有少女感，獲網民大讚骨相高級臉。而范冰冰就則以中國風白色露肩晚裝亮相，貼身的剪裁將S型好身材表露無遺，一舉一動都散發強大女王氣場。大批網民激讚冰冰神顏：「很美啊 她穿中國風的一點都不土」、「看照片都這樣了 不敢相像肉眼看有多美」、「她真的什麼風格都能駕馭」。</p><figure><img alt=\"范冰冰以中國風白色露肩晚裝亮相時裝周。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151152011115499520403769.jpeg/FoKFsefesG4MxgsRvjYNs4T3oOrUmZJmR9YbhUfWG4U\"/><figcaption>范冰冰以中國風白色露肩晚裝亮相時裝周。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"貼身的剪裁將冰冰的S型好身材表露無遺。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151152005356589056021789.jpeg/miLFpZeC2ROlrMLcgXJoQIrzErXTQs0_FRKw9xUSsPc\"/><figcaption>貼身的剪裁將冰冰的S型好身材表露無遺。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"冰冰一舉一動都散發強大女王氣場。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151152002080706560018425.jpeg/1Wl_Fk8p6gXL1k889eSpsngihiNBnLWjg-CyMoPgsjI\"/><figcaption>冰冰一舉一動都散發強大女王氣場。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"網民大讚范冰冰神顏再現。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151152113644998656896352.png/Tz5jnQxiggvjTz_EBqluh2-Sskwnk23MLRwYCy0cGAs\"/><figcaption>網民大讚范冰冰神顏再現。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"楊紫瓊穿搭從來不會失手。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151165075625873408302815.jpeg/88-G0gus9V4cZefeQwj5cAszrK7wP1W6i5fbZYuX22U\"/><figcaption>楊紫瓊穿搭從來不會失手。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"谷愛凌甜美又不失性感。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151165072819752960746359.jpeg/6W-Spgv9LAhfUQ6Flv13JlGeWIGU4-84Xi6Qc14ukHM\"/><figcaption>谷愛凌甜美又不失性感。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"韓韶禧仙氣滿滿。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151165069799723008395807.jpeg/WuFr_RJcJullT-DBfHHxQU_9yNzp0U4K_kM9QP5DPUA\"/><figcaption>韓韶禧仙氣滿滿。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Mingyu Deep V現身。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151165101337219072921640.jpeg/o4FgHAo2eBKVIHZd2dZxhFkMW57On88b0S8QN9EvEDc\"/><figcaption>Mingyu Deep V現身。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Emma Corrin以奇裝搶Fo。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151165097633517568793041.jpeg/LKzLPdg742OOt5ZT98VvOYVOxL5Y9OIT8_7Hm_P-x5s\"/><figcaption>Emma Corrin以奇裝搶Fo。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"Bad Bunny。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151165094131142656315694.jpeg/EPtyVVizDwtoji1eidqyd1zR3AqvBIscTG7ed0xu3nc\"/><figcaption>Bad Bunny。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"奚夢瑤。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151165090872037376980176.jpeg/fwP3C7isd8cLDPsxSPCntLOtU9uk5MCaDqm7mQ6pu5k\"/><figcaption>奚夢瑤。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure><figure><img alt=\"婚紗女王Vera Wang凍齡力驚人。（Getty Images）\" src=\"https://cdn.hk01.com/di/media/images/dw/20260707/1151165085473837056109547.jpeg/vCuIj302cZi80BpM9uDvtM3J5Gp4wmRj6qpz0Oqqc9A\"/><figcaption>婚紗女王Vera Wang凍齡力驚人。（Getty Images）</figcaption></figure></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-07-07T08:19:45.749369+00:00","quality":{"score":2,"chars":742,"images":14,"source":"HK01 娛樂","fallback":"none"}}